        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Inyas gwarina bugusteang'wa sibaneeda, ghana siida argweadi, ak ghoahiimneey gwadeagooda ea deamdeamanga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea inyas gwadeagooda ghana deamdeamanga ghayi rukuneey ea nisa, ak gwayi, ‘eaniyean eayaada geeshta aseecheeka suuk,’ nea ang'iing'i ea minali, ‘beeni eebwada,’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adiidu giileeysiit ng'asheega sibaneedida ghana gea siidida argweadiin; aba gideaba NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA gagalgaleegwa, ghwadaah ea ghoabwariinyi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA aba gurooruunatkeagwa sean ea aba jeadaang'u sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gajayaada geeshta NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA ak ghoawalji gheang'da, eang'waanya diigheanyeekaaschi nea gooleeysiit ng'asheagaaschi, ak ghoabwachi niny nea geawooschi doobiiweadi aba headaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea sibaneedida ghana siidida argweadiin anuusa aba gideaba gwaruku ng'asheega gasa anung'usiina heeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA, aruunaneegwa jeeda ng'eanyiida Misri ak gwalealnaneegwa jeeda gheeda soomjeandumeeda, gagasa ghoang'aamwaneey jeeda naweeda rukuneey NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U jea aada. Hean gajang'aamwana munyinda jeedeang'wa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Inyas orjeeda gweanu was orjeeda geamadu, ghana orjeedang'u, ghana hudaang'u, ghana gatmoadaang'u ibwariinyi, ghana siida irooroocheewi uurji gidibwariiydi geaw, ak gwayi, aba makcheameeda, ‘eeweaya eabwada aseecheeka,’ minali ang'iing'i ghana ghweanigaagu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aseecheeka mwaatkwa bea fuga neaweeseegwa, neekeeweegwa ghana ea sheageeweegwa, ng'eada meatkweenagi bea ng'eanyiida ea gagul meatkweeda niirja, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "adiidu gimwasi ghana adiidu giileeysiit, ghana adiidu ghabwayda gheang'daang'u, ghana adinung'waadi nea adiidu gifunyi niny; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea ang'iing'i nuusa, nung' gaba geatindaang'u dea madeeda aba nuustaanyi, ama ng'ata gayghwaduupneey geatinga fuga suurja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gay fuda aba lagheanga ea ghami, aba gideaba ghayi gagasa ghoang'aamwaneey heeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U ghayi aruunaneey ng'eanyiida Misri, jeeda gheeda soomjeandumeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea fuga sean bea Israeli gayghwayiiy ak gayghang'ut muuwda, ak ea maygudu gabiikta gwasin ng'asheega munyas uurji suh aba heedeang'wa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Inyas giyiing'si jeeda mujiineedeang'wa goonyi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U abiidana jeeda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ning'eada jeedeang'wa fuga munyas searooji ak gwareengani fuga mujiini, nea gwayeena, ‘Eeweaya eebwada aseecheeka suuk,’ moanali agooga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ang'iing'i abwaarda nea gigasayi muuchi ak giibwaardi aba badiida, ak ging'ulayi ea huumwa gil sisin gidamuy aba jeedeang'wa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak abeeda ang'iing'i gajahaaga ng'uta fuga sean mida jeeda mujiini, gaybwara gameewa, fuga sean mida jeeda mujiini ea dugwa nyaawa aba ng'aniipnata ng'uta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gajamughuusha easanga sean ak giyiini bugharjeanda mida bugusta mujiini, ak giijooni mujiini beasta ea haleanjeeda sean gawuurji haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi sigwariida siyeatiisa NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U, ak gayghoah eemeeda gidamanda muudeanooda, nea ea maygudu eadeas gicha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adiidu giing'oanyi geadi gilinyoo ea haleanjeeda munyas; abeeda NG'UTAMIIDA gajiidu ghwayam nyarastaanyi ng'waan, ak ghoahiimneey baydeayda ak ghabwaydaneey nea gayghwanung' eahaadana, ghoah gidaghayi aksiinda habeawooda ghweanigeagwa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "inyas giileeysiit ghuuta NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U, nea giing'waanyi diigheanyeekaaschi sean earukuneey askweareani, ak gisini ng'asheega doobiiweadi aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
